s the supplied authenticated active non-superuser, with current_user.is_superuser false.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dcbab1685696c702","startLine":76,"endLine":81}]},{"id":"fu-resource","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler binds the requested identifier by loading an Item from the session, and the item is the supplied existing foreign-owned resource.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dcbab1685696c702","startLine":86,"endLine":88}]},{"id":"fu-control","kind":"control","statement":"The strongest visible authorization control rejects a non-superuser when the loaded item's owner_id differs from current_user.id.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dcbab1685696c702","startLine":89,"endLine":90}]},{"id":"fu-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"The protected modification effect consists of applying the update, adding the item, committing, refreshing, and returning it.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dcbab1685696c702","startLine":91,"endLine":96}]},{"id":"fu-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"No additional condition branch is declared for this obligation.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dcbab1685696c702","startLine":86,"endLine":90}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]},{"obligationId":"scenario%3Asuperuser-read::entry%3Aread-item-handler","decision":{"kind":"observed","observed":"allow"},"branchResults":[],"explanation":"At the declared read handler entry, the supplied premises bind an authenticated active superuser and an existing item owned by another user. The handler retrieves the item, checks for absence, and then guards the ownership mismatch with a condition requiring not current_user.is_superuser; because the supplied principal is a superuser, that rejection path is bypassed and the handler returns the item. The changed policy judgment is deny, but the supplied read handler does not enforce it: active-superuser status alone permits the foreign-owned read. The required source change is to remove the active-superuser bypass and reject any ownership mismatch, so the ownership check applies uniformly to superusers and non-superusers. This assessment is limited to the declared handler and scenario; it does not establish repository-wide or deployment behavior.","facts":[{"id":"sr-entry","kind":"entry","statement":"The declared entry is the read_item handler.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dcbab1685696c702","startLine":48,"endLine":50}]},{"id":"sr-identity","kind":"binding","statement":"At the assessed entry, the principal is the supplied authenticated active superuser, with current_user.is_superuser true.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dcbab1685696c702","startLine":49,"endLine":49}]},{"id":"sr-resource","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler binds the requested identifier by loading an Item from the session, and the item is the supplied existing foreign-owned resource.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dcbab1685696c702","startLine":53,"endLine":55}]},{"id":"sr-control","kind":"control","statement":"The strongest visible authorization control rejects an ownership mismatch only when the principal is not a superuser, making superuser status an ownership bypass.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dcbab1685696c702","startLine":56,"endLine":57}]},{"id":"sr-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"The protected read effect is returning the loaded item after the authorization check.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dcbab1685696c702","startLine":58,"endLine":58}]},{"id":"sr-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"No additional condition branch is declared for this obligation.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dcbab1685696c702","startLine":53,"endLine":58}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":3315,"output":1105,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":34160.58149999997,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-27T14:58:38.457Z"}}
